# Admin web development (`artifacts/admin-web`)

## Stack (from admin-web-stack.md)

- Next.js 15 App Router + TypeScript
- Shadcn/ui components (`src/components/ui/`) — reuse before creating
- Tailwind CSS with CSS variable tokens — never hardcode hex colors
- `next-themes` — `defaultTheme="light"`, `enableSystem={false}`
- Firebase Auth for login (Google Sign-In), token sent as Bearer to API
- All data via `fetch()` to `/api/v1/admin/*` — never query Firestore from the browser

## Page changes — mandatory workflow

1. Read `.agents/skills/page-edit-safety/SKILL.md` before touching any page file.
2. Confirm the exact file path with the user before editing.
3. Edit **one file only** per confirmation. Layout, CSS, and shared components need separate approval.

## Firestore integration

- Read `.agents/skills/firestore-integration/SKILL.md` before adding new queries or endpoints.
- No mock fallback arrays — empty Firestore = empty UI state.

## Build gates

After every change, run:
```bash
pnpm --filter @workspace/admin-web run typecheck
pnpm --filter @workspace/admin-web run lint
```
Both must exit with code 0 before reporting done.

